## 各库结构速查

### RW.Common — 核心基础库

命名空间前缀 `RW.Common.*`，目录与命名空间一一对应：

| 目录 | 关键类型 |
|---|---|
| `Attributes\` | `AssignableAttribute`, `EnumDisplayAttribute`, `InitializeAttribute`, `TooltipAttribute` |
| `Commands\` | `MethodCommand`, `AsyncMethodCommand` |
| `Comparers\` | `CaseInsensitiveStringComparer`, `FilePathStringComparer` |
| `Cryptography\` | `Base64Helper`, `MD5Helper`, `UriHelper` |
| `Data\` | `Vector2`, `Vector2F`, `Vector2Int`, `Vector2Mutable`, `PrecisionBuilder` |
| `Data\Arrays\` | `ReadonlyMatrix` |
| `Data\Collections\` | `BidirectionalDictionary`, `ListDictionary` |
| `Data\Concurrent\` | `ConcurrentLinkedList` |
| `Data\Lists\` | `CyclicReadOnlyList`, `ExtendReadonlyList`, `ObjectReadonlyList`, `RangeDataReadList`, `ReversedReadonlyList`, `SelectorReadonlyList` |
| `Enums\` | `EncodingType`, `Vector2SortMode` |
| `Events\` | `PayloadEventArgs`, `PayloadCancelEventArgs`, `PropertyValueUpdatedEventArgs`, `TypedEventHandler` |
| `Exceptions\` | `FilePathNotFoundException` |
| `Helpers\` | `StringHelper`, `FileHelper`, `DirectoryHelper`, `NumberHelper`, `CollectionHelper`（Array/Collection/Enumerable/List/Matrix 分部）、`DictionaryHelper`, `DateTimeHelper`, `EnumHelper`, `ReflectionHelper`, `SerializationHelper`, `ProcessHelper`, `RandomHelper`, `RangeHelper`, `TypeHelper`, `DataTableHelper` 等 |
| `Interfaces\` | `IAssignable`, `IDataTable`, `IEnumDisplayHandler`, `IReadonlyMatrix`, `IVector2` |
| `Models\` | `BindModelBase`, `BindModelBaseEx`, `BindObject`, `EnumItem`, `ObjectWrapper`, `ObservableHashSet`, `Range`, `SimpleColor`, `VersionStruct` |
| `Utilities\` | `AssignUtility`, `EnumDisplayManagerBase`, `FolderNameValidator`, `PathValidator`, `RunLimiter` |

### RW.Common.WPF — WPF 扩展库

命名空间前缀 `RW.Common.WPF.*`，XAML 前缀习惯用 `wpf:`（`xmlns:wpf="RW.Common.WPF"`）：

| 目录 | 关键类型 |
|---|---|
| `Controls\` | `TitleContent`, `NumberBox`, `MenuButton`, `ButtonPopup`, `CustomPopup`, `NotifyIcon`, `FontIcon`, `DataGridExtended`, `EnumBindingComboBox`, `SpacingStackPanel`, `AutoColumnsUniformGrid`, `ClippingBorder` |
| `Converters\` | `Boolean2VisibilityConverter`, `EnumDisplayConverter`, `ColorToBrushConverter`, `FileSizeDisplayConverter`, `FormatConverter` 等 40+ 个通用转换器 |
| `Extensions\` | `BindingProxies`, `CommandProxy`, `ControlExtension`（Context/DragDrop/Focus/Keyboard/Layout/Loaded/Mouse 分部）、`WindowExtension`, `DataGridExtension`, `TextBoxExtension`, `TreeViewExtension`, `ViewModelExtension` 等 |
| `Helpers\` | `ViewHelper`, `WindowHelper`, `FileActionHelper`, `ColorHelper`, `DispatcherHelper`, `IconHelper`, `AppHelper`, `DataGridHelper`, `KeyboardHelper`, `SystemHelper` 等 |
| `MarkupExtensions\` | `EnumBindingMarkupExtension`, `StringFormatMarkupExtension` |
| `Models\` | `ContextMenuModel`, `CollectionSearchFilter`, `ControlTokenManager`, `JobObject` |
| `Utilities\` | `AsyncDebouncer`, `DebounceDispatcher`, `CaptureScreenshot`, `PropertyChangeNotifier`, `WindowActivator`, `EnumDisplayManagerWPF` |
| `Utilities\Timers\` | `CompensatingTimer`, `DispatcherTimerController`, `SystemTimerController`, `ThreadingTimerController`, `TimerControllerBase` |
| `ViewModels\` | `ViewModelBase`, `ContextMenuViewModel` |
| `Virtualization\` | `VirtualizingWrapPanel`, `VirtualizingItemsControl`, `VirtualizingPanelBase`, `ItemContainerManager` |
| `Interop\` | `InteropMethods`, `InteropValues` 及各类 `SafeHandle` 封装 |

### RW.Base.WPF — 应用框架层

命名空间前缀 `RW.Base.WPF.*`，XAML 前缀习惯用 `base:`（`xmlns:base="RW.Base.WPF"`）。
**应用的启动流程、依赖注入、生命周期、ViewModel 服务全部来自这个库**：

| 目录 | 关键类型 |
|---|---|
| （根） | `ApplicationBase` — `App` 的基类，驱动整个启动流程 |
| `Configs\` | `FolderConfig`, `DebugConfig`, `MapperConfig` |
| `DependencyInjections\` | `ISingletonDependency`, `ITransientDependency`, `INoDependency` |
| `Events\` | `IEventAggregator`, `EventAggregator`, `PubSubEvent`, `SubscriptionToken`, `ThreadOption` |
| `Extensions\` | `IoC`, `IoCInitializer`, `DllLoader`, `DISource`, `DebugLog`, `DebugLoggerBase`, `AppArgsService` |
| `Handlers\` | `NativeDragDropHandlerBase` |
| `Interfaces\` | `IStartup`, `IApplication`, `IAppManager`, `IFolderConfig`, `IStatusReport`, `IPriority`, `IAppInitialize`, `IAppInitializeAsync`, `IAppClosedHandler` |
| `Models\` | `AppDiagnosticsModel` |
| `Services\` | `JsonSettingsServiceBase`, `DiagnosticsService` |
| `ViewModels\` | `AppManager`, `StatusReport` |
| `ViewModelServices\` | `TypedUIObjectService`, `DispatcherServiceEx`, `MessageBoxService`, `CurrentWindowServiceEx`, `EventsService`, `FrameworkElementDragDropService` |

> **注意**：`IEventAggregator` 来自 `RW.Base.WPF.Events`，用 `using RW.Base.WPF.Events;` 引入。

